{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"The fourth run passes and improves most cases again, reaching roughly 2× on the smallest workloads. The sole regression is the 8192-token case: the pointwise Triton grid launches over two million workgroups there. I’m tuning that pass into a capped persistent grid (each workgroup processes multiple chunks), then I’ll retain it only if local long-context timing improves."}}
